  [1mWhy it's less than 2×:[0m the 48% share for ray tracing was measured under the
  profiler (cProfile). Ray tracing makes about 160,000 small function calls,
  so the profiler's own overhead inflated its share. The real saving was 6.6
  s, not the 11 s or so I expected. This explanation is my inference; I
  didn't measure it separately. For a full geometry's dataset, roughly 52 min
  becomes about 36 min.

